<title>UK: China Travel sets $150 mln Dec 2001 FRN.</title>
<headline>China Travel sets $150 mln Dec 2001 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers LTCB International Ltd and Sanwa International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHINA TRAVEL SERVICE (HOLDINGS) HONG KONG LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	SPREAD     +110 BP   MATURITY    13.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY **	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.35 PCT</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   **	  REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	**RATING IS NOT BEING SOUGHT</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 500     SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.15 PCT  SELL CONC   0.20 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
